            },
            "reviewBody": "I’ve made this twice now and its always a hit! The recipe is super easy and it doesn’t take long to make just to cool. It’s super rich in flavor and very chocolatey. The first time I made it with both types of toffee, but the second time I could only find the chocolate toffee bits either way it was super good.",
